  "requested_url": "https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/62594/crisp-pickled-green-beans/",
  "title": "Crisp Pickled Green Beans",
  "description": "These pickled green beans turn out tasty and crisp, with a wonderful garlicky dill flavor and a red pepper flake punch, ready to eat in 2 weeks.",
  "authors": [
    "Jani Whitsett"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-03T23:31:41-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-10-17T14:18:49-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT15M",
  "cook_time": "PT20M",
  "total_time": "PT20675M",
  "yield": [
    "48",
    "6 (½-pint) jars"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Side Dish"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "American"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "American"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "2.5 cups distilled white vinegar",
    "2 cups water",
    "0.25 cup salt",
    "1 clove garlic, peeled",
    "2.5 pounds fresh green beans",
    "6 large sprigs dill",
    "0.75 teaspoon red pepper flakes"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3YNB5tVsSNx5Hvst23-zgorlaXE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-62594-Crisp-Pickled-Green-Beans-ddmfs-4x3-ingredients-6c9db6736f764c5d9cb4c6fd164ef410.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62594/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inspect six ½-pint jars for cracks and rings for rust, discarding any defective ones. Immerse in simmering water. Wash new, unused lids and rings in warm soapy water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1ggtt4j8KmJcGGNdfFMmk522I8A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-62594-Crisp-Pickled-Green-Beans-ddmfs-4x3-step-01-91c1d9cc29a14f64b06740db82403abf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62594/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the jars are being sterilized, stir together vinegar, water, and salt in a large saucepan. Add garlic and bring to a rolling boil over high heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/z7g5VlVTsEtNwQXH99FghtQoloA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-62594-Crisp-Pickled-Green-Beans-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-27eba08748fa4ff0b31fd38339d78bec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62594/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Trim green beans to 1/4-inch shorter than the jars.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TEP8b5dw0e7OzEediV18KqNFJcs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-62594-Crisp-Pickled-Green-Beans-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-ecbd91f844c74d4b86c72eb6ceb79747.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62594/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove jars from simmering water. Place 1 sprig of dill and 1⁄8 teaspoon red pepper flakes in each jar. Pack in green beans standing on end.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M_C5PpGp5TGLcdKsSoWvVip1bwg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-62594-Crisp-Pickled-Green-Beans-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-9f24542b506a4ed5b77015bb2a19254f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62594/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ladle boiling brine (leave out garlic) into the jars, filling within ¼-inch of the tops. Seal jars with lids and rings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/r52iI__oqtcEl4dYTn-F1tnUsIY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-62594-Crisp-Pickled-Green-Beans-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-0228dab1019d421b9f0db9c3639b2ffc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62594/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a rack in the bottom of a large stockpot and fill halfway with water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jRLzvFnI0aq0aqkhStrBOcqUnrI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-62594-Crisp-Pickled-Green-Beans-ddmfs-4x3-step-06-a90bd05498be46bf88de76a62e52c6fc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62594/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring to a boil and lower jars 2 inches apart into the boiling water using a holder.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/s5hZBAUcHHhqVRsHbkDrQFkhRFo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-62594-Crisp-Pickled-Green-Beans-ddmfs-4x3-step-07-18c37c03e32d43eabaae3f05250a3f88.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62594/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in more boiling water to cover jars by at least 1 inch. Bring to a simmer (do not boil), cover, and process for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vwZJMRRUcfdZD0j0u0WfhFYD2Yk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-62594-Crisp-Pickled-Green-Beans-ddmfs-4x3-step-08-2ec1cc8868894f9fae56756612f94bb6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62594/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove jars from the stockpot and cool to room temperature, 8 to 12 hours. Test jars for a good seal by pressing on the center of the lid — it should not move.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pjATVGcOB-hVeBrH322SS874Hjw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-62594-Crisp-Pickled-Green-Beans-ddmfs-4x3-step-09-c5fed26f22d34dcdb574eb22cb602ee6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62594/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let green beans ferment for 2 to 3 weeks in a cool, dark space before eating.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iKpDAqqSbfA-nPySKZSkJchbNBw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-62594-Crisp-Pickled-Green-Beans-ddmfs-4x3-beauty-876e86890ac94d04862b0b46ce4ff348.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/62594/step_11.webp"
    }
  ],
